From 318052058ab2a5e3539d2cf6f8d2e06f5082fd3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?=EA=B9=80=EB=AF=BC=EA=B7=9C?= <kmg@MacBookAir.local>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 00:01:29 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] =?UTF-8?q?test:=20week6=20=ED=9B=84=EB=B3=B4=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EA=B2=80=EC=A6=9D=EA=B3=BC=20=EC=B5=9C=EC=A2=85=20=EA=B2=B0?=
